P3 features complete — 2026-07-29

## Feature 1: Table Transfer
- Backend: TablesService.transferTable() — validates order is active, target table is AVAILABLE, runs $transaction to swap tableId + flip statuses, emits socket events
- Controller: PATCH /tables/transfer
- Frontend (orders/page.tsx): TransferTableModal — loads non-current tables for branch, calls PATCH /tables/transfer; ArrowRightLeft button shown for DINE_IN non-closed orders; Receipt button for PAID orders

## Feature 2: Bill Split
- Backend: PaymentsService.splitBill() — distributes tax proportionally by item subtotal ratio, returns per-person breakdown
- Controller: POST /payments/split-bill
- Frontend (pos/page.tsx): SplitBillModal — 2/3/4-person split, radio per item, live per-person totals with proportional tax; Split Bill button shown when cart has items

## Feature 3: Inventory BOM Deduction
- Schema: Added MenuItemIngredient model (menuItemId, inventoryItemId, quantity); added ingredients[] to MenuItem, usedIn[] to InventoryItem
- Migration: 20260728210234_add_bom_ingredients
- Backend: InventoryService.deductForOrder() — called non-blocking from OrdersService.updateStatus() when status → SERVED or PAID; also added listIngredients/addIngredient/removeIngredient methods
- Controller: GET /inventory/ingredients/:menuItemId, POST /inventory/ingredients, DELETE /inventory/ingredients/:id
- Orders module now imports InventoryModule
- Frontend (menu/page.tsx): IngredientsDrawer — slide-in right panel per item showing linked ingredients with qty/unit, add form with inventory dropdown, delete button; FlaskConical icon button on each item card

## Feature 4: Digital Receipt
- Backend: OrdersService.getReceipt() — includes items, COMPLETED payments, restaurant/branch/customer/table
- Controller: GET /orders/:id/receipt
- Frontend (orders/[orderId]/receipt/page.tsx): Thermal-style receipt layout — restaurant/branch header, order meta, item list, pricing breakdown, payments section, print button with @media print CSS
- Customer-web: "View Receipt" link shown for SERVED/PAID orders, opens admin receipt page in new tab

